{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事は長文で、読んでくださるか、不安だったんですけど、読んで下さったかた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとーに嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温かいお言葉、心にジワァァァーっと響きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうパワー全開"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キラーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真は完全にOFFモードのまあやです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイムソーリーヒゲソーリー日本のそーりはノダソーリです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←華麗にスルーしてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは\nQandA\nスタートです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q まあやの優しさはお父さん似なのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aいいえ！まぁお父さん優しいけど、みんな優しい！母さんは時には厳しいよ！でも言ってることは間違ってないです。\nみんながいるからまあやは優しい！なーんってねっ(((^_^;)意味不明ですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 俺たちはちゃんと支えになっているかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 当たり前だの前田さん！\nはい！すみません。\nもちろんです！みんながいるからまあやがいます！ありがとー(*´∀｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qディズニーランドとディズニーシーどっち派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 2、3才くらいに行 っただけで覚えてないから、どっちも行きたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q ディズニーだけかな？USJ は？前のコメントちょっと嫌な気分にさせたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 行きたいー！小４の時に、家族皆でいったのー！楽しかったー(^o^)v"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ううん！正直な気持ちをありがとー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q ディズニーに行ったら最初に乗る乗り物は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A うーん！とーぶんいってないけぇわからーん！わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q玉入れに勝つ方法わかる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 全部コメントを読んでわかりました。とにかくがむしゃらにたま入れに玉を入れ続けてがんばります。\n素敵な言葉をありがとー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q誕生日のメッセージってとどいた？読んでくれてたらどうだっ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A  読みました！ほんとーにいつもありがとー！\nオウチに飾ってまふーっ！\n誕生日祝ってくれてうれしい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q やっぱまあやは七福神とか選抜にこだやるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A最初は凄くこだわった！今はどう？っと聞かれれば、違うとは言いきれない。\nでも七福神や選抜がすべてじゃない！\n今はそう思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q22なので握手会は場違いかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A えぇーーー(;゜∇゜)？？？なんでそんなことないですよ......。\n来てくれたら嬉しいです(^o^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q まあやファン愛称何がいい？\n和田一家、まあや一家、まあや組、まあや軍団、まあやファミリー、まあや族、チームまあや、など...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A まあ家族かっこいー！なんか強そう！そういうのあると凄いね！\n想像だけでもたのしー(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q まあや2推しでもいいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A まあやのこと気になってくれとんやからそれでいい！うれしいでー(^o^)！ありがとー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまあやは絵の方はどうですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A うーん！まえ、ばあちゃんの誕生日に絵の具で家族の絵とか書いたら、上手！ってよろこんでくれ\nてた(^o^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q ちゃんと寝れたかい？蚊は多くないかい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A うん！蚊は、大丈夫！でもO型だからきおつけなきゃっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！\n沢山のご質問有難うございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋といえばせーりん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは遅くなりましたが、名古屋ドームでのイベント！\n個別握手会レポを書きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋ドームでは、想像以上の沢山のかたが来てくださっててビックリしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トップリードさんもとっても面白くて、凄く楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ自己紹介は\n緊張してカタコトだね！\nっと、メイクさんに言われました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも確かにそうです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人で話すのって緊張するじゃぁんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私キャッチフレーズ考えなきゃっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーしよー？？？？\nなんかいいのないですか？わら"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に考えて下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんでほんで、個別はいつものかたや、初めてのお会いするかた、久しぶりのかた、沢山のかたがたにお会いできて嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また是非来てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなお笑い芸人さんは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では洗濯物しなきゃいけないからまたねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3372989/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye ＼(^o^)／"}],"source":"archive"}